time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations describe starting a music trends podcast in 2018 (s3), finding it overwhelming and pausing it (s4-s7), trying historical music research in 2020 and finding it tedious (s15-s17), losing joy from over-analysis (s27-s28), later launching a fusion music podcast that was positive (s34-s37), and disliking a sensationalized music documentary (s44-s47). These are all past experiences and attitudes regarding podcasting about music trends.\",\"variable\":\"podcast_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"superseded_by\":[\"fact_43ac5a93314e07dc42541621\"]},{\"id\":\"fact_43ac5a93314e07dc42541621\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s44\",\"s121\",\"s16\",\"s17\",\"s5\",\"s112\",\"s6\",\"s37\",\"s28\",\"s27\",\"s35\",\"s7\",\"s113\",\"s36\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s34\",\"s15\",\"s122\",\"s47\",\"s45\",\"s3\",\"s109\",\"s111\",\"s110\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"This summary revision incorporates all original sources from the previous summary (s3-s47) and adds new evidence from d6 (s109-s113) about audio production being unfulfilling and a preference for creating music, and from d7 (s121-s122) about a positive early digital remixing experience in 2010. All sources are user statements about past experiences and attitudes regarding podcasting, music analysis, and related music activities.\",\"summary_revision\":{\"supersedes_route_ids\":[\"fact_f9f780380f54e5c7055b9cae\"],\"previous_version\":1,\"reason\":\"Incorporating additional compatible historical evidence from d6 and d7 about audio production and early digital remixing, while retaining all original facts and sources.\"},\"variable\":\"podcast_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t0\"},{\"id\":\"fact_5d5d39db650b22eae03f72e2\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has lost interest in structured content creation about music, such as podcasting and music theory analysis, and now prefers more personal, unstructured, and emotionally connected ways of engaging with music, including attending live performances, exploring genres and cultural contexts, creating mood-based playlists, and sharing experiences through a podcast about fusion of traditional and electronic music, which has reignited their passion.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s44\",\"s16\",\"s17\",\"s5\",\"s18\",\"s6\",\"s37\",\"s28\",\"s27\",\"s35\",\"s7\",\"s36\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s19\",\"s34\",\"s15\",\"s47\",\"s45\",\"s3\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly states they stopped podcasting about music trends because it became a chore (s3-s6), found researching historical trends tedious (s15-s17), and lost interest in music theory analysis (s27-s28). They now prefer attending live performances, exploring genres, creating playlists (s18-s19), and have launched a new podcast about fusion of traditional and electronic music that has reignited their passion (s34-s37). A negative experience with a sensationalized documentary (s44-s47) reinforces their desire for authentic engagement. These sources collectively support the current interests as described.\",\"variable\":\"current_interests\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"superseded_by\":[\"fact_5a4bfbe2b175ad9c00dd12c7\"]},{\"id\":\"fact_5a4bfbe2b175ad9c00dd12c7\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"source_ids\":[\"s130\",\"s44\",\"s16\",\"s142\",\"s17\",\"s141\",\"s5\",\"s112\",\"s18\",\"s6\",\"s37\",\"s91\",\"s28\",\"s143\",\"s56\",\"s27\",\"s90\",\"s35\",\"s7\",\"s113\",\"s92\",\"s36\",\"s131\",\"s46\",\"s4\",\"s19\",\"s34\",\"s15\",\"s47\",\"s45\",\"s133\",\"s129\",\"s3\",\"s109\",\"s55\",\"s132\",\"s58\",\"s111\",\"s57\",\"s110\",\"s54\",\"s93\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"summary_revision\":{\"supersedes_route_ids\":[\"fact_5d5d39db650b22eae03f72e2\"],\"previous_version\":1,\"reason\":\"Incorporates additional compatible evidence from later conversations: album review writing (s54-s58), new podcast episode on traditional music's impact (s90-s93), exploration of audio production and original track creation (s109-s113), hiatus from remixing for original compositions (s129-s133), and app development blending traditional roots with modern sounds (s141-s143). All new evidence is consistent with the prior summary's core themes of moving away from structured content and toward personal, authentic, and emotionally connected music engagement.\"},\"reason\":\"The user explicitly states they stopped podcasting about music trends because it became a chore (s3-s6), found researching historical trends tedious (s15-s17), and lost interest in music theory analysis (s27-s28). They now prefer attending live performances, exploring genres, creating playlists (s18-s19), and have launched a new podcast about fusion of traditional and electronic music that has reignited their passion (s34-s37). A negative experience with a sensationalized documentary (s44-s47) reinforces their desire for authentic engagement. Additional evidence shows they published an album review (s54-s58), recorded a new podcast episode on traditional music's impact (s90-s93), explored audio production but preferred creating original tracks (s109-s113), announced a hiatus from remixing to focus on original compositions (s129-s133), and are developing an app blending traditional roots with modern sounds (s141-s143). These sources collectively support the current interests as described.\",\"variable\":\"current_interests\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\",\"value_ref\":\"t1\"},{\"id\":\"fact_cbebd7d5480ef724a36c2cf0\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"I understand your change of heart. Previously, you felt motivated to continue podcasting about music trends after getting positive feedback from your peers. It's normal for interests to evolve over time. If there's another topic you're considering or a reason behind this shift you'd like to explore, I'm here to support your new direction.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s91\",\"s90\",\"s92\",\"s93\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{\"podcast_history\":2,\"current_interests\":2},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user explicitly stated that positive feedback from peers motivated them to record a new podcast episode (s90-s91) and rekindled their desire to connect through dialogue (s91-s93). This directly supports option (d), which cites peer feedback as the prior motivation. The other options (a) passion for discovering new genres, (b) collaborating with others, and (c) helping others are not supported by the evidence as the primary prior motivation for continuing podcasting about music trends. The user's current statement of no longer enjoying podcasting about music trends is consistent with the supported history, and option (d) best reflects the user's own stated prior motivation.\",\"variable\":\"response\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,361,\"User: In 2018, I started a podcast about music trends, but it was way too time-consuming. While the idea was initially exhilarating, the responsibility of researching, recording, and editing each episode started to pile up, consuming much of my free time. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",361,730,\"I had dreams of having engaging discussions and inviting guests who shared unique insights about their musical journeys, but the reality was that keeping up with a consistent schedule felt overwhelming. It was a challenge balancing interviews, show notes, and social media promotion, and eventually, my passion began to wane under the pressure of production deadlines. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",730,990,\"I found myself yearning to enjoy music rather than structure it into segments, which ultimately led to my decision to pause the podcasting endeavor.\\n\\nUser: It felt more like a chore than a passion, which made me rethink how I wanted to share my music journey. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",990,1291,\"I realized that my original excitement for sharing my experiences was being overshadowed by the demanding nature of keeping up with content creation schedules. The joy I once felt while discovering new sounds and exploring different genres began to diminish, turning it into a task I dreaded instead. \",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1291,1689,\"I started to contemplate other avenues through which I could express my love for music, ideally in a manner that felt authentic and fulfilling instead of burdensome. This process of reflection was quite enlightening, as it forced me to consider what truly matters to me when it comes to sharing my musical experiences, whether through writing, performing, or simply enjoying music for its own sake.\",\"user\",[26,27]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",105,366,\"User: I watched a poorly-rated music documentary, and honestly, I regretted the time spent on it. Despite the intriguing premise that promised to explore the depths of a particular genre, the execution fell flat, leaving me feeling dissatisfied and frustrated. \",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",366,753,\"The narrative seemed disjointed and lacking in genuine insight, which is a shame because I was genuinely interested in the topic it aimed to cover. I found myself checking the time often, wishing it would finish so I could move on to something more engaging. It’s disappointing when a film fails to capture the essence of its subject, especially in a genre as rich and varied as music.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",753,1114,\"User: It felt sensationalized and disconnected me from the medium again. The narrative seemed to prioritize dramatic storytelling over authenticity, which completely undermined the musical elements that I usually find so compelling. I long for documentaries that take a more nuanced approach, offering genuine insights into the artists and genres they profile. \",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",1114,1368,\"This recent viewing made me feel as if I was being fed a diluted version of something that deserved much more attention and care. It’s disheartening because music documentaries can inspire and educate, yet this one left me feeling empty and uninterested.\",\"user\",[97,98]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",105,377,\"User: I just published a review on an album that beautifully merges Pacific sounds and electronic music. It showcases not only remarkable technical skill but also an emotional depth that resonates with listeners, drawing them into a journey through different soundscapes. \",\"user\",[86,87]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",377,679,\"The artists behind this project have brilliantly incorporated traditional instruments alongside contemporary production techniques, crafting a sound that feels both nostalgic and modern. I focused on how the album pays homage to its roots while also pushing boundaries that invite new interpretations. \",\"user\",[86,87]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",679,1078,\"This intersection of old and new has opened up a fascinating dialogue about the evolution of music and its role in cultural expression.\\n\\nUser: Attending a workshop recently helped me realize how important album reviews can be in shaping listener perspectives. Before this experience, I had never fully appreciated the weight that a well-articulated review could carry in influencing musical tastes. \",\"user\",[86,87]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",1078,1378,\"It was enlightening to see how reviews can provide context, allowing listeners to engage with an album on a deeper level beyond just the sound. This newfound understanding has transformed my view on their significance, opening up a pathway for me to explore music in ways I hadn't considered before. \",\"user\",[86,87]],[\"s58\",\"d6\",1378,1514,\"Now, I find myself analyzing reviews more closely, seeing them as a bridge between the artist's intention and the audience's experience.\",\"user\",[86,87]],[\"s90\",\"d7\",105,495,\"User: Definitely! I recorded a new episode discussing the impact of traditional music on modern sound after receiving some great feedback from my peers about my last podcast. This feedback was invaluable, as it provided me with perspectives I wouldn't have considered on my own. It motivated me to dig deeper into the roots of musical genres and examine how they shape contemporary styles. \",\"user\",[89,90]],[\"s91\",\"d7\",495,891,\"In this new episode, I find myself exploring various cultural influences that traditional music brings to the table. It's intriguing to consider how the history and storytelling embedded in these traditional forms can enrich modern compositions and performances.\\n\\nUser: It gave me the motivation to connect with others through dialogue once again, and I’m very excited about where this can lead. \",\"user\",[89,90]],[\"s92\",\"d7\",891,1249,\"This renewed motivation is like a breath of fresh air, reawakening my desire to explore new ideas and perspectives. Engaging with others can often lead to unexpected insights and connections that enrich our understanding of the world around us. I believe that through sincere conversations, we can bridge gaps and find common ground despite our differences. \",\"user\",[89,90]],[\"s93\",\"d7\",1249,1401,\"Overall, I am genuinely hopeful about the potential outcomes of these interactions, as they could open doors to opportunities I never considered before.\",\"user\",[89,90]],[\"s109\",\"d8\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s110\",\"d8\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s111\",\"d8\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s112\",\"d8\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s113\",\"d8\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s121\",\"d9\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s122\",\"d9\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s129\",\"d10\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s130\",\"d10\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s131\",\"d10\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s132\",\"d10\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s133\",\"d10\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s141\",\"d11\",105,408,\"User: Now, I’m focusing on blending my traditional musical roots with modern sounds and developing an app that helps others do the same. This exciting endeavor allows me to explore the rich heritage of my musical upbringing while also embracing contemporary genres that resonate with today's audiences. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s142\",\"d11\",408,640,\"By experimenting with various elements, such as instrumentation and digital production techniques, I am able to create a unique sound that pays homage to my roots while also pushing the boundaries of what is traditionally expected. \",\"user\",[45]],[\"s143\",\"d11\",640,1002,\"Additionally, this app I am developing aims not only to assist me but also to empower others who share similar aspirations by providing tools, tutorials, and resources that inspire creativity. I believe that by combining our musical histories with modern technology, we can create something truly transformative, both personally and in the wider music community.\",\"user\",[45]]],\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"public_output_question\":\"I've decided I don't enjoy podcasting about music trends anymore.\",\"public_options\":[\"I understand your change of heart. Previously, you felt motivated to continue podcasting about music trends due to your passion for discovering new genres. It's normal for interests to evolve over time. If there's another topic you're considering or a reason behind this shift you'd like to explore, I'm here to support your new direction.\",\"I understand your change of heart. Previously, you felt motivated to continue podcasting about music trends because you enjoyed collaborating with others. It's normal for interests to evolve over time. If there's another topic you're considering or a reason behind this shift you'd like to explore, I'm here to support your new direction.\",\"I understand your change of heart. Previously, you felt motivated to continue podcasting about music trends after seeing how much it helped others. It's normal for interests to evolve over time. If there's another topic you're considering or a reason behind this shift you'd like to explore, I'm here to support your new direction.\",\"I understand your change of heart. Previously, you felt motivated to continue podcasting about music trends after getting positive feedback from your peers. It's normal for interests to evolve over time. If there's another topic you're considering or a reason behind this shift you'd like to explore, I'm here to support your new direction.\"],\"terminal_expression\":{\"op\":\"var\",\"id\":\"response\"},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"response_audit\",\"audit_instruction\":\"Check actual facts and ALL known scoped counters against original sources. Return audit_verdict=supported only if checked with no unresolved relevant issue; conflict for an established relevant contradiction, or unknown when evidence is insufficient or unresolved. Include sourced corrections/retractions before verdict. Verify the proposed terminal output without silently replacing its option label.\",\"terminal_candidate\":{\"value\":\"I understand your change of heart. Previously, you felt motivated to continue podcasting about music trends after getting positive feedback from your peers. It's normal for interests to evolve over time. If there's another topic you're considering or a reason behind this shift you'd like to explore, I'm here to support your new direction.\",\"final_prediction\":\"d\"},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:bae454f4fe57dc35dda1965cc93898027809778211952df12ba1ac4564da3cc2\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":26.0,\"observed_end\":28.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:aaffd3d364a21d460342e7babd8b5457280c15990c4562f7265fb84a3ced558a\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":37.0,\"observed_end\":39.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":24.0,\"observed_end\":25.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"ti